---
import Container from "@components/layout/Container.astro";import Section from "@components/common/Section.astro";import SectionHeading from "@components/common/SectionHeading.astro";import Reveal from "@components/decorative/Reveal.astro";import PaintStroke from "@components/decorative/PaintStroke.astro";import GeometricFigure from "@components/decorative/GeometricFigure.astro";
---
<Section class="audience"><Container><div class="audience__grid"><Reveal class="audience__art"><PaintStroke src="/assets/reference/home-audience.webp" width={380} height={205}/><GeometricFigure class="audience__figure" size={210}/></Reveal><Reveal class="audience__copy" delay={90}><SectionHeading>Для кого этот проект</SectionHeading><p>SKV для людей, которые хотят лучше понимать себя, свои реакции. Для людей, которые хотят менять качество собственной жизни и качество взаимодействия с ней.</p></Reveal></div></Container></Section>
<style>.audience{padding-block:70px}.audience__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:center;gap:clamp(60px,9vw,145px)}.audience__art{position:relative;min-height:260px;margin-left:calc(var(--container-padding)*-1)}.audience__art :global(.paint-stroke){position:absolute;inset:0}.audience__art :global(img){width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:right center}.audience__figure{position:absolute;right:-20px;top:-50px;z-index:2}.audience__copy{max-width:520px}.audience__copy p{margin-top:28px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75}@media(max-width:760px){.audience__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.audience__art{min-height:200px;order:2}}</style>
